From: Chen Shunqing <csq@rock-chips.com>
Date: Tue, 19 Mar 2024 14:43:31 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 56/82] media: i2c: rk628: add cec register for csi_v4l2

Type: Function
Redmine ID: N/A
Associated modifications: N/A
Test: N/A

Signed-off-by: Chen Shunqing <csq@rock-chips.com>
Change-Id: I2ff2aedb323165ca3c1b95ae609f66facb1b61bb
---
 drivers/media/i2c/rk628/rk628_csi_v4l2.c | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/media/i2c/rk628/rk628_csi_v4l2.c b/drivers/media/i2c/rk628/rk628_csi_v4l2.c
index 5ca56fa242a1..719addd0d56d 100644
--- a/drivers/media/i2c/rk628/rk628_csi_v4l2.c
+++ b/drivers/media/i2c/rk628/rk628_csi_v4l2.c
@@ -3186,6 +3186,9 @@ static int rk628_csi_probe(struct i2c_client *client,
 	csi->rk628->dual_mipi = false;
 	rk628_debugfs_create(csi->rk628);
 
+	if (csi->cec_enable)
+		csi->cec = rk628_hdmirx_cec_register(rk628);
+
 	v4l2_info(sd, "%s found @ 0x%x (%s)\n", client->name,
 		  client->addr << 1, client->adapter->name);
 
